        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Physics cockpit\nEnums are shown as recorded text, never 0/1. Park is confirmed `Gear=P`; Neutral is rolling. Charge `Stopped` is a pause, `Complete` is at limit and still plugged — only `Disconnected`/explicit Disconnected state is unplug. Values follow Settings → Units via the SI converters. Empty = no data, never zero-filled."
